      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i just accidentally got some of that liquid dish soap in my eye while doing dishes. it feels really scratchy and looks a bit red. i have some old of those antibiotic eye drops in my medicine cabinet from a few months ago... do u think i should just put some of that in to make sure it doesn't get infected?",
