    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i already rinsed it a bit but it still feels kinda weird. i don't really want to go to the urgent care if i don't have to, it's a hassle. won't those antibiotic drops actually help clean it out or something? i mean they're meant to kill bacteria and stuff so wouldn't that be safer than just letting the soap sit there?",
